              "type": "string",
              "value": "For following algorithms get required mandatory inputs { \"Attribute_name\": \" \",\n        \"Table_name\": \" \"} and perform Data Assessment :\nAlgorithms: Churn Propensity, Next Best Offer, Next Best Action"
            },
